<h2><b>What Is the Venus Bliss MAX and How Does It Contour the Body?</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Venus Bliss MAX is a non-invasive body-contouring platform from Venus Concept that combines three technologies in a single treatment session: diode-laser lipolysis, multipolar radiofrequency, and lymphatic drainage. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The 1064nm diode laser heats subcutaneous fat cells, triggering lipolysis and gradual elimination of disrupted fat cells through the body&#8217;s lymphatic system. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The multipolar RF component heats the deeper skin layers to stimulate collagen production and tighten the skin, thereby softening the skin after fat reduction. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The lymphatic drainage phase supports tissue clearance and reduces fluid retention, improving visible contouring results.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Venus Bliss MAX is FDA-cleared for non-invasive lipolysis of the abdomen and flanks for patients with a BMI of 30 or less, and is clinically proven to reduce adipose layer thickness by up to 41%. Sessions run approximately 30 minutes with no anesthesia, no needles, and no downtime. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Most clients require 4–8 weekly sessions to achieve their full contouring outcome. The center&#8217;s</span><a href="https://www.medaestheticsmiami.com/body-transformation/venus-bliss-max-miami/"> <span style="font-weight: 400;">Venus Bliss MAX service page</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> covers treatment areas and session protocols in detail.</span></p>
