										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Med Aesthetics Miami is a top-rated med spa for Morpheus8 in South Florida, holding InMode&#8217;s 2025 Top Morpheus8 Provider designation and a 4.9-star Google rating from 340 reviewed patients. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The clinic operates 3 licensed locations across Coral Gables, Aventura, and Lauderdale-by-the-Sea, led by Rosanna Bermejo, MBA, MSN, NP, a nurse practitioner with more than 15 years of experience in aesthetic medicine. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Independent platforms, including Groupon, ClassPass, Yelp, and Expertise, have each ranked the practice among South Florida&#8217;s best med spas.</span></p>
<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">InMode — the manufacturer of the Morpheus8 device — designated Med Aesthetics Miami a 2025 Top Provider, a credential awarded for clinical volume, patient outcomes, and demonstrated device mastery, not self-nomination.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Med Aesthetics Miami holds a 4.9-star Google rating from 340 patients and appears on 5 independent ranking platforms: Groupon, Google, ClassPass, Yelp, and Expertise.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rosanna Bermejo, MBA, MSN, NP, leads the clinic, supported by board-certified Laser Aesthetic Surgeon Dr. Alejandro Espaillat, M.D., trained at Harvard and Brown Universities.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Morpheus8 sessions at Med Aesthetics Miami start at $470 for eyes and $1,000 for face and neck, with package pricing available across all 4 treatment zones.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Sagging skin along the jaw or neck deserves a provider with a verified record, not just a polished website.</span><a href="https://www.medaestheticsmiami.com/appointments/"> <span style="font-weight: 400;">Book a Morpheus8 consultation</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> at Med Aesthetics Miami&#8217;s location closest to you.</span></p>
<h2>Is Med Aesthetics Miami a top-rated med spa for Morpheus8?</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Med Aesthetics Miami qualifies as a top-rated Morpheus8 provider by 3 measurable standards: manufacturer recognition, independent platform rankings, and patient review volume. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">InMode named Med Aesthetics Miami a 2025 Top Morpheus8 Provider — a designation awarded to a select group of providers nationwide for clinical proficiency and sustained patient demand, as confirmed in the</span><a href="https://natlawreview.com/press-releases/med-aesthetics-miami-named-2025-top-morpheus8-provider-inmode"> <span style="font-weight: 400;">official InMode press announcement</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Beyond the InMode designation, 5 independent platforms — Groupon, Google, ClassPass, Yelp, and Expertise — have each ranked Med Aesthetics Miami among South Florida&#8217;s best. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Med Aesthetics Miami holds a 4.9-star Google rating from 340 patients, placing it among the higher-rated providers in the Miami metro area for RF microneedling treatments.</span></p>
<h2>What Credentials and Recognition Back Up Med Aesthetics Miami&#8217;s Morpheus8 Reputation<span style="font-weight: 400;">? </span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Three categories of credentials distinguish Med Aesthetics Miami from the broader field of Miami med spas offering Morpheus8: manufacturer designation, regulatory compliance, and multi-platform recognition.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The InMode Top Provider designation is awarded directly by the device manufacturer and reflects consistent treatment delivery, clinical proficiency, and sustained patient demand — not a purchased badge or self-nomination. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">InMode operates in more than 90 countries and designates Top Providers from a global pool of Morpheus8 practitioners. Being listed among that group places Med Aesthetics Miami within a select tier of providers worldwide.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">On the regulatory side, Med Aesthetics Miami holds all certifications required by the Florida Department of Health for a facility performing energy-based treatments, laser procedures, and injectable services. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Florida&#8217;s medical spa framework, governed by the Florida Department of Health, requires that clinical staff operate within their licensed scope and that qualified medical oversight be maintained for procedures that fall within the practice of medicine. Every Med Aesthetics Miami location operates under that standard.</span></p>
