<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Bermejo holds a Registered Nursing degree (RN, BSN), a Master of Science in Nursing as a Family Nurse Practitioner, completed in 2023, and active memberships in the Dermatology Nurses&#8217; Association, the International Society of Plastic and Aesthetic Nurses, and the American Society for Laser Medicine and Surgery. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Before building Med Aesthetics Miami, Bermejo spent years in Fortune 500 corporate roles, then pursued clinical credentials in skin care, laser hair removal, and body treatments.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Dr. Alejandro Espaillat, M.D., serves as board-certified Laser Aesthetic Surgeon and clinical consultant for the practice. Espaillat trained at Harvard and Brown Universities, bringing surgical-level clinical oversight to the practice&#8217;s advanced treatment protocols. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The combination of a credentialed nurse practitioner founder and a Harvard- and Brown-trained board-certified surgeon represents a clinical leadership structure that most single-location Miami med spas do not match.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Every Morpheus8 treatment is performed by a fully licensed and certified technician or aesthetician trained under the clinic’s</span><a href="https://www.medaestheticsmiami.com/about/our-story/"> <span style="font-weight: 400;">Skin &amp; Beyond methodology</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, which governs training standards, device calibration, and patient assessment across all 3 locations.</span></p>
